{"c":[{"name":"20261005T180513Z-82a90a8786c261a8","text":"G2: live Jev (Ask's yes/no value question, 0.75 floor) confirmed Order number but not a reply's sender in To or a derived calendar event for 'add this meeting to my calendar and draft a reply to Priya', so D2-06 scene 2 ends partial live; see evidence/screen/g2 jev-*-probe.txt.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T201333Z-b3e261779dc6c92b","text":"L1: no chat route is a default (WRITER_ROUTE and INTENT_ROUTE null, ASK_MAKER jev); a developer names one as groq:<model> or gateway:<model> (writer/routes.ts) with the helper's --dev-writer or an eval script's writer flag.","type":"note"}]}
